  "captions": {
    "tiktok": "Ranking every monologue I heard at the stage door today. Juliet F, Hamlet D, Shylock C, Isabella from The White Devil S. Where would you put her? The voice is AI. #monologue #audition #actortok #tierlist #theatrekid",
    "youtube_title": "Ranking every monologue I heard at the stage door today.",
    "youtube_description": "Ranking every monologue I heard at the stage door today.\nMilo's scarf is shut in the stage door, so he hears the whole callback line. Juliet's Gallop apace gets an F, Hamlet's To be or not to be a D, Shylock a C. Then Isabella from John Webster's The White Devil, 1:11, found in Ghost Light by describing her, goes in S. His taste, not a casting rule. Where would you put her? Free on the App Store. Built by a working actor. The voice is AI.\n#monologue #audition #acting #tierlist",
    "instagram": "Ranking every monologue I heard at the stage door today.\n\nF: Juliet, Gallop apace. Heard her six times.\nD: Hamlet, To be or not to be.\nC: Shylock, Hath not a Jew eyes.\nS: Isabella from John Webster's The White Devil. 1:11, and nobody in the line brought her.\n\nMilo's taste, not a casting rule. Where would you put her?\n\nHe found her in Ghost Light by describing her: a woman who wishes she were a man so she could take revenge. Free on the App Store, built by a working actor. Link in bio. The voice is AI.\n\n#monologue #audition #actorslife #tierlist #shakespeare"
  },
